# Every prebuilt Luau binary is excluded, not just the Linux ones: the
# Dockerfile compiles Luau inside the image (engines/luraph/build_luau.py) so
# the binary always matches the image's glibc. A host .exe left in the context
# is dead weight at best and a wrong-arch trap at worst.
engines/luraph/bin/luau-linux
engines/luraph/bin/luau
engines/luraph/bin/luau-ast
engines/luraph/bin/luau.exe
engines/luraph/bin/luau-ast.exe
engines/luraph/bin/luau.zip
